  "question": {
    "text": "The term independent of <em><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> </em>in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup></math> &nbsp;is",
