  "solution": {
    "text": "We know,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#8658;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Hence, the given binomial becomes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup></math>.<br /><br />General term <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>r</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Hence, for term independent of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br />&nbsp;We get <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> <rb><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Term Independent of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>210</mn></math></rb><br />&nbsp;",
